      "id": "claim_44480c0adf084e5288b5592db3a47d3c",
      "statement": "apps/web/src/lib/api.ts is the sole network boundary for the Next.js frontend: pages and components import its typed functions (fetchDatasheets, fetchStratagems, fetchRosters, fetchRoster, createRoster, updateRoster, deleteRoster, auditRoster, uploadMiniaturePhoto, deleteMiniaturePhoto, fetchChangelog, checkHealth) rather than calling fetch themselves.",
