      "id": "claim_3c5f8acc117842a1bdf23bf97cb634ca",
      "statement": "Because apiFetch awaits response.json() before checking response.ok, a non-JSON error body (proxy 502, HTML rate-limit page) rejects with a SyntaxError instead of an ApiError, and wrappers that swallow all errors cannot distinguish the two.",
