      "id": "claim_ac56c752460644beb680d6074c6f13bf",
      "statement": "getStoredRosters returns [DEFAULT_STARTER_ARMY] on the server, for an absent key, a non-array, and an empty array; DEFAULT_STARTER_ARMY is a complete UserArmy fixture (starter-ultramarines-roster, ruleset 11.1.0-2026-Q3, 2000-point limit, three Astartes units totalling 355 points) rather than a placeholder shape.",
