    {
      "id": "claim_6f5a8091fccb4b78898c7a2e1ab28258",
      "statement": "fetchRosters mirrors a non-empty remote array into localStorage and returns it, falling through to getStoredRosters on error or on an empty remote list, so a signed-in user with zero rosters can never see an empty list; fetchRoster upserts the remote roster into storage on success and otherwise returns the stored match or a clone of DEFAULT_STARTER_ARMY carrying the requested id.",
