      "id": "claim_f59e25e2f00541758282d6818662fa63",
      "statement": "updateRoster merges the patch with stored state, writes localStorage via saveStoredRosters BEFORE issuing the PUT, swallows any PUT failure, and returns the locally computed UserArmy (browser-stamped updatedAt), discarding the server response; deleteRoster filters and saves storage first, swallows DELETE failure, and always resolves { deleted: true }.",
