      "id": "claim_391f5d996add4d0e89776db003ede320",
      "statement": "createRoster POSTs /rosters and on failure synthesizes a local army with id army_<Date.now()>_<rand>, ruleset 11.1.0-2026-Q3 and an empty rosterPayload, then unshifts it into localStorage regardless of origin; because that id was never created server-side, a later PUT/DELETE for it gets 404 NOT_FOUND which the client also swallows.",
