      "id": "claim_15b0a3f9bbce44619d2e1ec9d8750951",
      "statement": "saveStoredRosters swallows localStorage write failures and remote write errors are caught and ignored with no dirty flag, sync queue, conflict detection or retry, so local and server roster state can drift (local-ahead edits never persisted, a later successful fetchRosters overwriting unsynced local edits, and ghost deletes where a failed DELETE leaves the roster server-side) with no repair path.",
